      "end": 1695,
      "source_sha256": "00598173ab325466107c0714f610063bf0b512ee30bd501ece61b45dd1b1cc75",
      "translation": "露，欢迎回来。"
    },
    {
      "start": 2391,
      "end": 4515,
      "source_sha256": "1ed036f428dc1a7b52046baca30c41a9a1a900dbf82d1a9afdce2df7b6af8954",
      "translation": "我刚刚抵达，公主殿下。"
    },
    {
      "start": 5388,
      "end": 8132,
      "source_sha256": "e935bb63109375bfbd0df10fce5c0bbefb642d13e971cc0d2e17d8c567561c47",
      "translation": "露能平安回来，真是太好了。"
    },
    {
      "start": 8986,
      "end": 9664,
      "source_sha256": "81cb656d660d3db9717b57c6000e331a7af8e789d65335cd72f7b897b973bb08",
      "translation": "不过……"
    },
    {
      "start": 9864,
      "end": 15356,
      "source_sha256": "073749474b342d2812de1005f183b10a0a1bc080b52e90325ec6f39483517055",
      "translation": "听说我不在的时候，公主殿下<br>好几次亲自上了战场？"
    },
    {
      "start": 16669,
      "end": 19178,
      "source_sha256": "fbf840cf9518bf2fe7353375384238091b8e031699436a07689be82aed518e1a",
      "translation": "刚回来就开始唠叨了啊……"
    },
    {
      "start": 22296,
      "end": 26203,
      "source_sha256": "613227e2dee91b68229287d4cd59b31426f6cf5106265723adcace4dfa00b67c",
      "translation": "克罗塞尔、阿尔戈，<br>你们两个到底都在干什么？"
    },
    {
      "start": 26800,
      "end": 33054,
      "source_sha256": "b2624d976d8a1404f2a4a667b2a09968ec40681e9c1ed948bcaf392641dc88d0",
      "translation": "竟然让公主殿下陷入那样的险境，<br>你们倒是辩解几句啊。"
    }
  ]
